{
  "about": "A new non-special class that defines no clothing map at all (BARE CLASS in harness_swap) wears the vanilla Peasant's clothes. Regression: putting it into a vanilla cell crashed (scr_set_class_spr_data: .clothing_standard not set before reading it).",
